Cell["\<\
Sets the named external-tool paths (leaving the rest unchanged) and persists \
them; reapplied on the next Get[\"SubTropica`\"].\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3e362502-ace0-40a0-a622-49ec0786464d"],

